1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,411
Why are the maxima of a grating so sharp?

2
00:00:03,411 --> 00:00:06,692
Watch the pattern as the number of slits grows.

3
00:00:06,692 --> 00:00:10,247
Two slits give broad cos squared fringes.

4
00:00:10,247 --> 00:00:11,835
Five slits sharpen them.

5
00:00:11,835 --> 00:00:15,130
Twenty, and the bright lines are needle thin.

